'''Gingerbread''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 6th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The whole knife is made out of gingerbread, hence the name. The edge of the blade is covered in a thick coat of frosting with pieces of candy in between each gap. The handle has five pieces of candy in a vertical line and frosting on the bottom.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Gingerbread Gun (2020)|partner gun]] under the same name.

